msgid "Pored lavaboa, na kuki ili na polici — peškirići se uklope u svaki dom i unesu trunku topline."
msgstr "By the sink, on a hook or a shelf — the towels fit into any home and add a touch of warmth."

msgid "Spremni za jutarnju rutinu"
msgstr "Ready for the morning routine"

msgid "Na kuki, uvek pri ruci"
msgstr "On the hook, always at hand"

msgid "Stiže spremno za poklon"
msgstr "Arrives gift-ready"

msgid "Svaki paket je mali poklon"
msgstr "Every package is a little gift"

msgid "Pažljivo upakovano u CosyPaw kutiju, sa porukom dobrodošlice i mirisom lavande. Trio paket stiže uz <strong>besplatnu dostavu</strong> — idealno za rođendan, bebi šauer ili samo da nekog razmaziš."
msgstr "Carefully packed in a CosyPaw box, with a welcome note and a scent of lavender. The Trio package arrives with <strong>free shipping</strong> — perfect for a birthday, baby shower, or just to spoil someone."

